# 05 Analytics Events

## Goal
Maintain a consistent event taxonomy for MVP metrics and release decisions.

## Canonical event names
- onboarding_started
- onboarding_completed
- quiz_started
- question_answered
- quiz_completed
- reward_granted
- xp_gained
- token_earned
- streak_updated
- leaderboard_viewed
- paywall_viewed
- purchase_started
- purchase_completed

## Always
- Use consistent snake_case naming.
- Define required parameters per event before implementation.
- Log one event once per user action (no duplicate multi-layer logging).
- Keep event semantics stable over time.

## Prohibited
- Renaming events without migration notes.
- Emitting duplicate events from multiple layers for the same action.
- Tracking sensitive user data not required for product decisions.
